{
  "_readme": "Single source of truth for the LAZY JO UNIVERSE (/lazyjo/): the 28 songs of the album JAVEDA in album order, then newer singles (no `track`) (the same order as the JAVEDA levels; the flight passes them left/right in this order). The client renders this list and server.js reads the SAME file to price Stripe checkouts, so prices can't be tampered with from the browser. previewUrl = the public JAVEDA level song in the Supabase 'media' bucket (the player stops after 30 s). masterPath = the object key of the WAV in the PRIVATE bucket LAZYJO_MASTERS_BUCKET (default 'lazyjo-masters'), only handed out as a short-lived signed URL after Stripe confirms payment. Upload the WAVs with: node scripts/upload-masters.js <folder> (Jo's PC). cover = the official single artwork (client/public/lazyjo/covers/NN-id.webp, 800px, taken from Apple Music on 2026-11-23); year = its release year. cover null -> generated artwork in the palette colours. priceCents = the minimum (server-enforced), suggestedCents = the preselected amount in the player. forSale: false = the WAV isn't uploaded yet: the song shows 'WAV coming soon' and the server refuses its checkout. Remove the line once its WAV is in the bucket. palette = [dark, accent, accent 2] picked from the cover: the player (border, buttons, Buy) and the 3D frame use it. youtube = the song's music video (same ids as JAVEDA's FAN_VIDEOS): its cover plays a 30 s loop from `start` (seconds), and the preview is the video's sound; `zoom` hides black bars.",
